======================================================================
  Architecture Diagram: Phase 191 - Capstone 1: Scalable URL Shortener
======================================================================

1. Simplest Baseline Architecture:
----------------------------------------------------------------------
   In-memory dictionary that loses data upon process restart.

   [Client] ──▶ [Application Server] ──▶ [Primary Datastore]


2. Scaled / Resilient Architecture:
----------------------------------------------------------------------
   FastAPI gateway + Base62 Snowflake ID + SQLite/Postgres + Redis cache + async worker queue.

                               ┌──▶ [Worker Node A] ──┬──▶ [Cache]
[Client] ──▶ [Load Balancer] ──┼──▶ [Worker Node B] ──┤
                               └──▶ [Worker Node C] ──┴──▶ [Primary DB] ──▶ [Replicas]
                                         │
                                         ▼
                                   [Event Queue] ──▶ [Async Workers]

======================================================================
